{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120686","id":3947226317,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7rReTN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120686","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120686.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120686.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120686","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120686/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120686/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120686/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aca15001c729c8222995298dfbdc214bffb9fdc3","number":120686,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `add_apple_embedded_platform_spm_package` method to `EditorExportPlugin`","user":{"login":"cengiz-pz","id":112892340,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrqZtA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112892340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz","html_url":"https://github.com/cengiz-pz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15079\r\n\r\n## Notes:\r\n\r\n**(1)** Kept the `PluginConfigAppleEmbedded::SPMPackage` and `EditorExportPlugin::AppleEmbeddedSPMPackage` struct duplication because the coupling required to remove it would be worse than the duplication itself.\r\n\r\nThe two structs live at different architectural layers:\r\n\r\n- `PluginConfigAppleEmbedded::SPMPackage` belongs to the config-file parsing layer: it's a data record produced by reading a `.gdip` file and is Apple-platform-specific by definition.\r\n- `EditorExportPlugin::AppleEmbeddedSPMPackage` belongs to the export plugin API layer: it's the public interface a cross-platform plugin class exposes to GDScript and C++ callers.\r\n\r\nAny deduplication strategy has to bridge those two layers, and all the options have worse properties than the current 3-line field-copy:\r\n\r\n**Option A** - `editor_export_plugin.h` includes `plugin_config_apple_embedded.h`\r\nThis pulls a platform-specific header (`plugin_config_apple_embedded`, which itself includes `core/io/config_file.h`, `core/string/ustring.h` etc. and carries Apple semantics in its name and constants) into a generic class that Android and desktop plugins also subclass. Every non-Apple export plugin would now silently carry Apple config-parsing baggage.\r\n\r\n**Option B** - `plugin_config_apple_embedded.h` includes `editor_export_plugin.h`\r\nConfig file parser would need to know about the export plugin API, GDCLASS machinery, RefCounted, and the rest of the editor export system. That's a much heavier include for a struct that currently only needs `core/io/config_file.h`.\r\n\r\n**Option C** - a shared third header (e.g., `editor/export/apple_embedded_export_types.h`)\r\nThis avoids the bad dependency directions, but the payoff doesn't justify a new file, in my opinion. The shared content would be a 5-line struct. Both files would gain an include, and the conversion site in `_export_apple_embedded_plugins` would go away, but we would have traded one boilerplate location for one new file that future contributors have to discover and remember exists.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.gi